#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&sonnet; is the spelling checker used by &kde; applications such as &kate;, "
"&kmail;, and &kword;. It is a &GUI; frontend to <application>International "
"ISpell</application> and <application>ASpell</application>."
msgstr ""
"&sonnet; é o sistema de comprobación da ortografía empregado polos programas "
"de &kde;, como &kate;, &kmail; e &kword;. É unha &GUI; para "
"<application>International ISpell</application> e <application>ASpell</"
"application>."

